&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[SCP-999 is introduced to the test area, SCP-5942 is introduced to test area. SCP-5942 appears to be very confused, SCP-999 moves toward SCP-5942 and is kicked across the Test area. SCP-999 moves back toward SCP-5942, 5942 goes away from 999, SCP-5942 then stomps on 999 then [Data Lost]&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-252500-2&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; thirty minutes since touching SCP-999s slime and appears to be immune to 999s effect, after gaining resistance from 999 SCP-5942 then roars and all personnel in Site ██ was killed]&lt;/p&gt;
