&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-662&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tissue Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
N/A&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Termination Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Mr. Deeds is summoned, and asked if he can destroy SCP-5942 permanently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mr. Deeds&#039; response: &amp;quot;I&#039;m terribly sorry, sir, I&#039;m afraid I can&#039;t.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mr. Deeds is asked if he can kill SCP-5942.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mr. Deeds&#039; response: &amp;quot;Again, sir, I&#039;m terribly sorry, but I&#039;m afraid I can&#039;t.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mr. Deeds is asked if he can incapacitate SCP-5942.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mr. Deeds&#039; response: &amp;quot;As a matter of fact… depending on how sir means the word &#039;incapacitate&#039;, and depending on how long sir wishes the creature to be incapacitated… yes for a few seconds at most.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mr. Deeds is asked to expand on how he would perform such an action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mr. Deeds&#039; response: &amp;quot;Sir, the simplest and quickest method — which I must point out would not be the most efficient — would be for me to offer myself up for the creature to devour me; certainly its offensive capacities would be lessened whilst it is occupied in consuming my flesh. This would be simplest as it requires no preparation on my part, sir, but I&#039;m certain you&#039;ll understand that the overall effect on the creature would be insignificant. Were I to engage the creature in combat, either with or without weapons, I could certainly occupy its attention and offensive capacities for a longer interval; unfortunately, I&#039;m afraid the creature would eventually defeat me, at which point it would begin consuming my flesh as I have previously described. However, I could certainly booby-trap my person with a variety of noxious substances - soporifics, perhaps, or explosives, or perhaps encapsulated neurotoxins, or even [REDACTED], so that when the creature does inevitably consume me, it sustains further damage. That said, sir, I must remind you that the creature&#039;s tendency towards regeneration means that any damage I inflict would be sadly temporary about a few seconds at most.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mr. Deeds is thanked and dismissed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note: Mr. Deeds&#039; knowledge of [REDACTED] is not to be considered a security breach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item:&lt;/strong&gt; ●●|●●●●●|●●|●&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tissue Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
N/A&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Termination Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5942 was restrained in the testing area and the laser was introduced. Laser began cutting into SCP-5942&#039;s back; command room emergency shutter was closed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Log&amp;gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;lt;9 seconds&amp;gt; SCP-5942: What are you doing?&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;lt;13 seconds&amp;gt; Laser begins carving infohazardous data onto SCP-5942&#039;s scales, SCP-5942 emits a loud roar&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;lt;14 seconds&amp;gt; command room emergency shutter closes&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;lt;2 minutes, 4 seconds&amp;gt; Laser finishes cutting&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;lt;2 minutes, 6 seconds&amp;gt; ●●|●●●●●|●●|● manifests&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;lt;2 minutes, 12 seconds&amp;gt; SCP-5942 breaks restraints&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;lt;2 minutes, 14 seconds&amp;gt; ●●|●●●●●|●●|● latches onto SCP-5942&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;lt;2 minutes, 15 seconds&amp;gt; SCP-5942 begins shouting curses&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;lt;2 minutes, 16 seconds&amp;gt; ●●|●●●●●|●●|● demanifests, ●●|●●●●●|●●|● was unable to get the scale.&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;lt;2 minutes, 25 seconds&amp;gt; SCP-5942 roars, all personnel at Site ██ start to describe ●●|●●●●●|●●|●&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;lt;2 minutes, 16 seconds&amp;gt; ●●|●●●●●|●●|● manifest and takes all personnel at Site ██.&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;lt;End Log&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
