&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;SCP-5942 killer&amp;quot;, dispensed from SCP-294&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tissue Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt; Upon contact with the liquid, sample began to fall, diminished to a fine powder within three (3) minutes of application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Termination Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Acid in the containment chamber of SCP-5942 was temporarily receded. Approximately ten (10) liters of the dispensed liquid was poured on the head of SCP-5942. Portions of SCP-5942&#039;s head began to fall of and dissolve. Upon submersion of the containment chamber, the affected areas immediately was expunged from existence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item:&lt;/strong&gt; 1 ton of liquid nitrogen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tissue Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Sample froze solid. When struck by a hammer, it shattered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Termination test record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
The nitrogen was poured onto SCP-5942 from above. SCP-5942 became frozen solid and remained so for approximately 3 seconds, until it began generating intense heat from within. SCP-5942 was fully thawed within 3 minutes, but continued to increase its body temperature. Test aborted when SCP-5942&#039;s body became so hot that it began to melt through the sides of its containment chamber.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note: Interesting, it retained the adaption even after it was no longer necessary. Maybe we should be more careful. -Dr. Carlson&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item:&lt;/strong&gt; Vacuum&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tissue Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
N/A&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Termination Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-████ was used to remove all of the air from SCP-5942&#039;s containment chamber. SCP-5942 appeared to enter a dormant state, exhibiting no detectable life signs for the duration of the test. However, readings indicated that the chamber had begun to fill with a gas mixture consisting of&lt;br /&gt;
37.1% AML F7437&amp;#160;22.9% ozone 10% cyanide 5% Compound 1080&amp;#160;5% Anthrax 30% chlorine. Upon reaching a density of ███ kg/m3, the mixture began to react chemically with the walls of the containment chamber, creating a substance similar to [DATA EXPUNGED]. A sample of the mixture was taken, and the test was then aborted. When normal Earth atmosphere was reintroduced to the chamber, it reacted with the mixture, causing an explosion that destroyed the blast door of the testing chamber. Fortunately, the explosion also damaged other SCP-Containment cells resulting in a mass containment breach. Incident 5942-H&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item:&lt;/strong&gt; 4&amp;#160;Jägers: (See SCP-5942 Document 5942-5)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tissue Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
N/A&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Termination Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5942was put in the test area after it was repaired from incident 5942-H, the 4&amp;#160;Jägers were placed in the chamber and fought 5942, the fight lasted for five (5) hours before SCP-5942 destroys the third Jäger, as three (3) of all the Jägers were damaged beyond repair or destroyed, Grey (fourth Jäger) was heavily damaged.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note: Jägers need improvement and upgrades for effective fight SCP-5942.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5942 (Gate Guardian)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tissue Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Tissue sample placed on drone and directed towards SCP-5942. Drone struck by SCP-5942-2 and obliterated from existence upon entering the 1&amp;#160;km area around SCP-5942.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Termination Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5942 securely transported to Site 0. SCP-5942 was told that SCP-001 insulted it to lure SCP-5942 to SCP-001&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Log&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;SCP-5942 is struck by SCP-001-2 and obliterated. SCP-5942 survives SCP-5942-2, as does a backup camera. SCP-5942 has a burn, having a open, bleeding wound in the center of its chest. SCP-5942 begins walking towards SCP-001.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5942:&lt;/strong&gt; (Looks at SCP-001&#039;s head) What did you say? DIE! No I will not.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SCP-5942 is struck by SCP-001-2. SCP-5942 survives, wounded, having lost one limb. SCP-5942 regenerates lost limb. walks toward SCP-001.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5942:&lt;/strong&gt; DIE? You command me to DIE? I AM GO AND YOU WILL NOT BE ABLE TO KILL ME!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SCP-5942 is struck again by SCP-001-2. SCP-5942 is extremely injured, and losses 13% of its initial body mass but persists as a result of its anomalous resilience and regenerates from damage.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5942:&lt;/strong&gt; YOU ARE FULL OF [Expletive removed] (SCP-5942 spits towards SCP-001.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SCP-5942 is struck 3 times by SCP-001-2. SCP-5942 survives having lost all its limbs and 90.7% of its initial body mass, having its head and parts of its neck left. SCP-5942 regenerates all damage and then SCP-5942 says You are a pest on my planet then is struck again.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5942:&lt;/strong&gt; (Insults SCP-001 then [Data Lost])[Expletive removed] YOU.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Personnel enter the 1km boundary around SCP-001. They report hearing &amp;quot;REMOVE!&amp;quot; from SCP-5942, and suffer a compulsion to collect the skeleton of SCP-5942. SCP-5942 is returned to containment with heavy resistance from SCP-5942 which is regenerating its entire body.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Log&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item:&lt;/strong&gt; Rapid Application of High Precision Blades&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Test Notes:&lt;/strong&gt; All previous attempts seem to be entirely focused on total elimination of SCP-5942. Why not try to render it into something easier to contain?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tissue test record:&lt;/strong&gt; A 25 cm3 cube of tissue was successfully divided into 25 one cm3 cubes. These cubes rapidly changed form once placed in individual containment but proved incapable of generating enough force to breach individual containment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Termination Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5942&amp;#160;s brought in to the test are, High Precision Blades are put in are. SCP-5942 laughs and says you think that affect me? No it won&#039;t You&#039;ve just given me immunity to any sharp object! The blades then were activated, the blades failed and only scratched SCP-5942&#039;s scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notes: Although SCP-5942 was found to be immune to the High Precision Blades, It has been discovered that SCP-5942 can gain &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;immunity to non-anomalous objects when tested on tissue samples&lt;/span&gt; [[footnote] [SCP-5942 cannot gain immunity from anomalous objects/entities [[/footnote]]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-939-██ and SCP-939-███&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tissue Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Not attacked by SCP-939-████ nor SCP-939-███&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Termination Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-939-██ and SCP-939-███ both entered the containment cell for SCP-5942. SCP-939-██ and SCP-939-███ were seemingly distressed and kept distance from 5942, while repeating the words Help Us. SCP-5942 then attacked the two, brutally mutilating both subjects, after 3 minutes SCP-5942 then devoured the bodies of SCP-939-████ nor SCP-939-███.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-3108&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tissue Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
N/A&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Termination Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
D-4563 was instructed to enter SCP-5942&#039;s containment chamber and shoot SCP-5942 with SCP-3108. After missing 9 times due to fear, D-1782 successfully hit SCP-544 with an SCP-3108-1 instance. However, the SCP-3108-1 instance bounced off SCP-5942 and hit D-4563, who was turned&lt;br /&gt;
into a human sized Uroplatus fimbriatus (giant leaf-tailed gecko).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-017&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tissue Test Record&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Sample “swallowed” by SCP-017 without incident.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Termination Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-017 entered the cell of SCP-5942 and moved towards it, at which point the lamps were manipulated so that SCP-5942&#039;s shadow would be cast on SCP-017. SCP-017 enveloped SCP-5942 but its shadow remained. The shadow of SCP-5942&#039;s moved away from SCP-017 then appeared to stand up and opened its mouth, presumably creating a loud scream followed by the emanation of an anomalous wave that caused all human bodies within a 1-kilometer radius to immediately burst in to in a way that the insides of the ones within a kilometer exploded. Their shadows remained and could move on any surface there was light was touching, at which point most of them appeared to panic and tried to flee. SCP-5942 was then expelled from SCP-017 appeared to be the same than when pre-enveloped. It was later determined that SCP-5942&#039;s mass was boosted by that of the anomalous wave&#039;s victims. The containment of SCP-5942 and SCP-017 failed and the two entities escaped successful re-containment. Security footage showed SCP-017 had pursued all humans caught in the anomalous wave created by SCP-5942 and their shadows disappeared when SCP-017 touched the area they were cast on. SCP-017 was re-contained without incident. No personnel on Site-██ survived. SCP-5942 was shown to be immune to the effects of SCP-017 post-breach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note:&lt;br /&gt;
All personnel on Site-██ were killed, SCP-5942 escaped and was nearly breached the Foundations Secrecy and almost lead to SCP-017&#039;s and other SCP items contained at Site-██ containment preeminently failing. I would suggest punishing whoever proposed this test but SCP-017 got to them before I could. This could have led to an XK-Class End of the World Scenario. All I can say is can we please stop &lt;em&gt;[Expletive Removed]&lt;/em&gt; with the Giant God.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Researcher: Anonymous&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item:&lt;/strong&gt; Not really an item, just letting SCP-5942 out to see what it&#039;ll do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tissue test record:&lt;/strong&gt; N/A&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Termination log:&lt;/strong&gt; Denied by O5-Command&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notes by O5-██ : I&#039;ll tell you what it&#039;ll do. It&#039;ll go out for a nice stroll, murder a bunch of innocent people, go have some people for supper, blow up a city, start up a murdering people-company, destroy Washington DC, go on a vacation to Florida, dismember more people, eat a nuclear power plant, destroy Europe, steal all the nukes in the world and eat the nukes for radiation, go Thermonuclear, blow up the SOLAR SYSTEM! I swear, when I find out who wrote this, you will be thrown in 5942&#039;s old containment chamber with 5942 inside so you analyze him yourself!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-106 and SCP-682&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note: The following incident occurred during a dual containment breach of SCP-106 and SCP-682&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tissue test record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
N/A&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Termination log:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-106 and SCP-682 both break into 5942&#039;s containment. There is no indication either item did this deliberately. Once the three items became aware of the others’ presence, all ceased movements and regarded each other with visible hostility, resulting a stalemate. 5942 broke this stalemate by teleporting itself. SCP-106 peruses SCP-5942 attempting to apprehend 5942, who responded by teleporting itself to 682. All three items were presumably transported to 106’s pocket dimension. After a period of eighteen hours, all three items manifested back in 5942’s containment chamber, bearing heavy wounds from prolonged combat all except for 5942 who has no visible damage. 106 was the first to leave the area, returning to its containment cell. MTF teams deployed in preparation for the return of the items were able to apprehend 682 witch had its body mass reduced by 98%, but has recovered and continued to fight 5942, after eight hours of fighting SCP-5942 blasted SCP-682 then slipped on SCP-106s mucus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The following day SCP-5942 breached containment and broke in to SCP-682. SCP-5942 [Data Lost]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notes: It seems SCP-5942 has a short temper and will get revenge one way or another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item:&lt;/strong&gt; Experimental Bio-Weapon&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tissue Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt; N/A, weapon is non-anomalous&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Termination Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
The weapon was put in SCP-5942&#039;s test chamber and activated. it did not appear to do anything but after 1 minute, SCP-5942 started to have seizures and acted like an insane person. after 5 minutes SCP-5942&#039;s scales started to fall off and regenerate. after 3 hours the effect started to fade and after 4 hours since initial exposure, SCP-5942 showed no signs of being affected and the test was aborted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-3700&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tissue Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt; N/A&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Test Notes:&lt;/strong&gt; While SCP-5942 was using its anomalous properties to search Foundation Database it came across SCP-3700&#039;s file, after about 10 minutes SCP-5942 swam toward SCP-3700&#039;s area of effect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Termination Test Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5942 arrives at SCP-3700&#039;s area of effect, Foundation Naval Task Force Delta-7 encounters SCP-5942 witch was in new form (5), this form was 5.97km in height and 13.76km in length, after talking to Foundation Naval Task Force Delta-7, they encounter SCP-3700-1 who acknowledges their presence, after approximately 3 hours SCP-3700-2 was encountered. SCP-5942 and SCP-3700-1 engage SCP-3700-2, Foundation Naval Task Force Delta-7 supports them by following Protocol Winter Maelstrom, after 2 hours of fighting SCP-5942 is eaten by SCP-3700-2 and releases a pulse of radiation. SCP-5942 and [Data Lost].&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-conquest&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6724738&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608562615&quot; alt=&quot;Dr Conquest&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6724738)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-conquest&quot;  &gt;Dr Conquest&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-252500-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Due to Emergency Procedure HALO &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Termination Attempts on SCP-5942&lt;br /&gt;
is strictly prohibited&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-252500-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Deleted by SCP-5942&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
