I'm finally used to seein' with my one eye, so I was able to get my still up and runnin' again!</em>&quot; Written by Vivarium.</li> </ul> <h4><span>Misc</span></h4> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/more-acs-icons">If you want more cool ACS secondary class icons</a> - Exactly what it says on the tin. Made by ShineShadowD, translated by Dr Fishbone.</li> </ul> <h3><span>Week of November 22nd:</span></h3> <h4><span>SCPs</span></h4> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4604">SCP-4604</a> (&quot;Disillusionment&quot;) - So, you too, you have experienced that, uh? Written by TL333s.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5936">SCP-5936</a> (&quot;Those that do not wish to be forgotten&quot;) - Ah, yes, y'know, the ode I talked about above? It's for these exact persons. Ralliston hadn't forgotten.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4576">SCP-4576</a> (&quot;Protective Prickly Pal, Prixors&quot;) - And here's an example of a good Added Alliterative Appeal. Written by Quadraginta.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5702">SCP-5702</a> (&quot;'www.wikiflick.███'&quot;) - It seems that the Wikijump initiative have been more efficient than we initially thought. LordStonefish have been even able to provide us a preview of the new platform.</li> </ul> <h4><span>Tales</span></h4> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/from-syllables-to-lines-to-imagination">From syllables to lines to imagination</a> - &quot;<em>Am hungry, gimme a munchy!</em>&quot; Written by Sirslash47.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/fox-hunt">Fox Hunt</a> - &quot;<em>If you can point me in the direction of an expert, or provide some insight yourself, I would be in your debt.</em>&quot; Written by Grigori Karpin.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/t-aint-no-sin">T'Ain't No Sin</a> - &quot;<em>Uwuu, you stiww have skin?! Teehee! No wowwies, Imma hewp you get wid of it</em>&quot; Written by daveyoufool.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/chef-s-table